Fix the CMake build system for distribution packaging:
- require CMake >= 3.10 (CMake 4 rejects < 3.5 compatibility)
- stop forcing CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE, -O3 and -std=c++11; respect user CFLAGS/CXXFLAGS
- build with C++17
- do not write build output to /tmp/build
- do not create symlinks outside DESTDIR; leave udev rules, dll.d and docs to the package
- add BUILD_GUI and BUILD_SCANSDK options (driver-only build without Qt)

